  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The volume of the parallelepiped is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>n</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>158</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>158</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>152</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>164</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;no real roots of&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>164</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>